                         QUERY PLAN                          
-------------------------------------------------------------
 Remote Subquery Scan on all (datanodes 2)
   ->  Hash Join
         Hash Cond: (b.c3 = a.c3)
         ->  Remote Subquery Scan on all (datanodes 1)
               Distribute results by S: c3
               ->  Seq Scan on sub1 b
                     Filter: (c1 = 1)
         ->  Hash
               ->  Remote Subquery Scan on all (datanodes 2)
                     Distribute results by S: c3
                     ->  Hash Join
                           Hash Cond: (c.c1 = a.c1)
                           ->  HashAggregate
                                 Group Key: c.c1
                                 ->  Seq Scan on sub1 c
                           ->  Hash
                                 ->  Seq Scan on sub1 a
(17 rows)

